      "description": "Filtros de inicio; seleccionado en tinta.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-chips\"><button class=\"ds-chip\" aria-pressed=\"true\">Todas <b>8</b></button><button class=\"ds-chip\">Mías <b>3</b></button><button class=\"ds-chip\">Hoy <b>2</b></button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-chips{display:flex;gap:8px}.ds-chip{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;height:40px;padding:0 16px;border-radius:9999px;background:#F1EBCB;color:#151515;border:2px solid transparent;font:600 14px/1 \"DM Sans\",system-ui,sans-serif;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 200ms cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1),transform 120ms}.ds-chip b{font-weight:700;font-size:12px;opacity:.7;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.ds-chip[aria-pressed=\"true\"]{background:#151515;color:#FBF6DC}.ds-chip:active{transform:scale(.95)}.ds-chip:focus-visible{outline:none;box-shadow:0 0 0 3px #FBF6DC,0 0 0 5.5px #151515}"
