      "html": "<div style=\"display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;padding:12px;background:#F0B4BE;border-radius:16px\"><span class=\"ds-st ds-st--ok\"><i></i>En 4 d</span><span class=\"ds-st ds-st--soon\"><i></i>Hoy 18:00</span><span class=\"ds-st ds-st--over\"><i></i>Vencida hace 2 d</span><span class=\"ds-st ds-st--done\"><i></i>Hecha</span></div>",
