      "description": "Input en trigo; al enfocar, borde de tinta y fondo blanco.",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-field\"><span>Nombre</span><input class=\"ds-input\" placeholder=\"Ej. Regar las plantas\"></label>",
      "css": ".ds-field{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;width:280px}.ds-field span{font:600 13px/1.2 \"DM Sans\",sans-serif;color:#5E5A48;padding-left:4px}.ds-input{min-height:48px;padding:0 16px;border-radius:16px;background:#F1EBCB;border:2px solid transparent;color:#151515;font:500 16px/1.3 \"DM Sans\",sans-serif;transition:border-color 200ms,background-color 200ms}.ds-input::placeholder{color:#5E5A48}.ds-input:hover{border-color:rgb(21 21 21 / .18)}.ds-input:focus,.ds-input:focus-visible{outline:none;border-color:#151515;background:#FFFFFF}"
